flowchart TD
    Start([Fix / Install / Uninstall]) --> Lock[Acquire 全局 APM 锁]
    Lock --> Recover[Recover：读取并校验唯一 transactions/active.json]
    Recover -->|无 journal| Debug[可选锁内 Debug]
    Recover -->|schema v1 shared envelope| Driver{driver}
    Driver -->|filesystem| FS[filesystem Skill/Agent 恢复]
    Driver -->|agent-cli| CLI[按 journal Agent ResolveMCP]
    Driver -->|plugin| Plugin[按 journal Agent ResolvePlugin]
    FS --> FSType{journal.Power.Type}
    FSType -->|skill| Converge
    FSType -->|agent| AgentValidate[经 AgentAdapterResolver.ResolveAgent → ValidateArtifact：install commit 校验 target 匹配新 PowerRef，install rollback 校验 backup 匹配 previous PowerRef，uninstall rollback 校验 quarantine 匹配当前 PowerRef；uninstall commit 内容将被删除，无需业务身份校验]
    AgentValidate -->|通过| Converge
    AgentValidate -->|身份不匹配 / resolver 缺失或 nil| AgentFail[ErrIndeterminateState；保留 journal 与恢复材料，不改 manifest、不继续清理]
    CLI --> InspectMCP[Agent CLI Inspect 同名 MCP]
    InspectMCP --> Converge
    Plugin --> InspectPlugin[Adapter Inspect 实际名/marketplace；只使用 manifest 与已有 immutable artifact，不连接 Cloud 或 Plugin Resource Ensure]
    InspectPlugin --> Converge
    Converge --> Delete[收敛后删除同一个 journal]
    Delete --> Warn[锁内同步恢复 Warn]
    Debug --> Command{当前命令}
    Warn --> Command
    Command -->|Fix| FixRelease[Release 后退出]
    Command -->|Install / Uninstall| Business[继续锁内变更业务，完成后 Release]
    Recover -->|其他格式或非法 driver/payload| Fail[ErrInvalidJournal；原样保留 journal]
    InspectMCP -->|CLI/输出不确定| Fail
    InspectPlugin -->|CLI/路径不确定| Fail
    AgentFail --> Fail
    Converge -->|失败或不确定| Fail
    Fail --> ErrorRelease[Release 并阻止当前业务]
